-- A single-cell depletion against a fixed BHP. The PROPS section is 1D_COMP.DATA's verbatim: same
-- three components, same Peng-Robinson data, same SGOF, same surface conditions.
--
-- The sibling deck one directory up is the same case on a surface OIL RATE. This one exists
-- because that control turned out to be unusable as an oracle: flowexp_comp meters 30 sm3/day of
-- surface oil as 3.8% fewer moles than its own PTFlash says that stream is, so a rate-controlled
-- comparison inherits a discrepancy that is the reference's and not the model's.
--
-- NOTHING IN THIS DECK GOES THROUGH A SURFACE VOLUME. The rate is set by the physics, and what is
-- compared is the pressure path, the gas saturation and the overall composition.
--
-- The composition is the distinctive part. Once the cell is two phase, gas is produced
-- preferentially, so `z` moves away from the deck's [0.1, 0.3, 0.6] - methane falls and decane
-- rises - and nothing else in C12 tests that. In the 1D displacement the cells are simply flooded
-- with CO2.
--
-- This variant also runs to completion, where the rate-controlled one aborts one step after gas
-- appears. The phase APPEARANCE itself is bracketed by that deck rather than this one: here the
-- cell crosses its saturation pressure inside the first reported day.

------------------------------------------------------------------------
RUNSPEC
------------------------------------------------------------------------
TITLE
   SINGLE CELL DEPLETION BHP

METRIC

TABDIMS
/
OIL
GAS
DIMENS
1 1 1
/

COMPS
3 /

WELLDIMS
1 1 1* 1/

START
  1 'JAN' 2016  /

REGDIMS
1 1 0 0 /

UNIFIN
UNIFOUT
------------------------------------------------------------------------
GRID
------------------------------------------------------------------------
INIT

DXV
100
/
DYV
100
/
DZV
10
/

TOPS
1*0
/

PERMX
1*100
/

PERMY
1*100
/

PERMZ
1*100
/

PORO
1*0.1
/
------------------------------------------------------------------------
EDIT
------------------------------------------------------------------------


------------------------------------------------------------------------
PROPS
------------------------------------------------------------------------

CNAMES
CO2
METHANE
DECANE
/

ROCK
68.9476
0
/


--RTEMP
--150
--/

EOS
PR /

BIC
0
0
0
/

ACF
0.22394
0.01142
0.4884
/
PCRIT
73.773
45.992
21.03
/
TCRIT
304.128
190.564
617.7
/
MW
44.00
16.04
142.28
/

VCRIT
0.09412
0.09863
0.60980
/

SGOF
-- Sg    Krg    Kro    Pcgo
0.0000 0.0000 1.0000 0.0000
0.0500 0.0025 0.9025 0.0000
0.1000 0.0100 0.8100 0.0000
0.1500 0.0225 0.7225 0.0000
0.2000 0.0400 0.6400 0.0000
0.2500 0.0625 0.5625 0.0000
0.3000 0.0900 0.4900 0.0000
0.3500 0.1225 0.4225 0.0000
0.4000 0.1600 0.3600 0.0000
0.4500 0.2025 0.3025 0.0000
0.5000 0.2500 0.2500 0.0000
0.5500 0.3025 0.2025 0.0000
0.6000 0.3600 0.1600 0.0000
0.6500 0.4225 0.1225 0.0000
0.7000 0.4900 0.0900 0.0000
0.7500 0.5625 0.0625 0.0000
0.8000 0.6400 0.0400 0.0000
0.8500 0.7225 0.0225 0.0000
0.9000 0.8100 0.0100 0.0000
0.9500 0.9025 0.0025 0.0000
1.0000 1.0000 0.0000 0.0000
/


STCOND
15.0 1.0 /


------------------------------------------------------------------------
SOLUTION
------------------------------------------------------------------------


PRESSURE
1*150.
/
SGAS
1*0.
/
TEMPI
1*150
/
ZMF
1*0.1
1*0.3
1*0.6
/
RPTRST
BASIC=2
PRESSURE
SGAS
SOIL
PSAT
XMF
YMF
ZMF
DENO
DENG
VGAS
VOIL
/

------------------------------------------------------------------------
SUMMARY
------------------------------------------------------------------------
ALL

------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCHEDULE
------------------------------------------------------------------------

RPTRST
BASIC = 2
PRESSURE
SGAS
SOIL
PSAT
XMF
YMF
ZMF
DENO
DENG
VGAS
VOIL
/

WELSPECS
PROD FIELD 1 1 1* OIL /
/
COMPDAT
PROD 1 1 1 1 OPEN 2* 0.0151 /
/
WCONPROD
PROD OPEN BHP 5* 80 /
/

TSTEP
    20*1.0
/
END
